'''Yuma Kuga & Doge''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Yuma Kuga & Doge
|image = E 618.png
|appearance = [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
He has a relatively short attack rate, Omni Strike and the ability to Strengthen at 50% health. All of this on top of his high speed can potentially allow him to push through an under-prepared army.

==Strategy==
Due to his low range, even with his [[Omni Strike]] ability, he can be countered fairly easily by units such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]].

